  "solution": "Given equation: 28 × 4 + 15 ÷ 8 – 34 = 388.\n\nBODMAS Table: \n\n [IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/d50192f098c21078501d30eeafe1a8c64bc30dd9621c48caa8a39ffc60f68b64.png] \n\nLet's check each option one by one.\n\nOption 1) × and ÷; 28 and 8\n\nGiven: 28 × 4 + 15 ÷ 8 – 34 = 388\n\nAfter interchanging the Symbols & Numbers we get;\n\n⇒ __**8 ÷ 4**__ + 15 × 28 – 34 = 388\n\n⇒ 2 + __**15 × 28**__ – 34 = 388\n\n⇒ __**2 + 420**__ – 34 = 388\n\n⇒ **4**__**22 - 34**__ = 388\n\n⇒ **388 = 388**\n\n⇒ **LHS = RHS**\n\nOption 2) + and ÷; 4 and 34\n\nGiven: 28 × 4 + 15 ÷ 8 – 34 = 388\n\nAfter interchanging the Symbols & Numbers we get;\n\n⇒ 28 × __**34 ÷ 15**__ + 8 – 4 = 388\n\n⇒ __**28 × ****2__**.26 + 8 – 4 = 388\n\n⇒ __**63.28 +**____** 8**__ – 4 = 388\n\n⇒ __71.28____ – 4__ = 388\n\n⇒ 67.28 ≠ 388\n\n⇒ LHS ≠ RHS\n\nOption 3) – and ×; 15 and 28\n\nGiven: 28 × 4 + 15 ÷ 8 – 34 = 388\n\nAfter interchanging the Symbols & Numbers we get;\n\n⇒ 15 - 4 + __**28 ÷ 8**__ × 34 = 388\n\n⇒ 15 - 4 + __**4.5 × 34**__ = 388\n\n⇒ __**15**__ - 4 __**+ 153**__ = 388\n\n⇒ __**168**____** - 4**__ = 388\n\n⇒ 164 ≠ 388\n\n⇒ LHS ≠ RHS\n\nOption 4) + and ×; 15 and 8\n\nGiven: 28 × 4 + 15 ÷ 8 – 34 = 388\n\nAfter interchanging the Symbols & Numbers we get;\n\n⇒ 28 + 4 × __**8 ÷ 15**__ – 34 = 388\n\n⇒ 28 + __**4 **____**× 0.53**__ - 34 = 388\n\n⇒ 28 + 2.12 - 34 = 388\n\n⇒ 30.12 - 34 = 388\n\n⇒ -3.88 ≠ 388\n\n⇒ LHS ≠ RHS\n\nHence, the correct answer is \"Option 1\".",
